{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_tippi_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_tippi_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"获奖感言","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"昔日辉煌的制片厂面临倒闭，蒂比不得不与即将离开蓝卡坞的同事分别。三人潜入制片厂的仓库，只为再见一次当年共同写下的签名。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_tippi_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["制片厂老板","摄影师","场记","蒂比","场记&蒂比","马修","艾琳","马修&蒂比","保安"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"卓越影业，自创立以来辛苦经营十余年，拍摄了众多脍炙人口的深夜影片。","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"最鼎盛的时候，我们的摄影棚没有一天空闲，影院的午夜场全是我们出品的电影。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"可这两年来，我们的票房成绩越来越差，几部大制作电影接连失利。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"现在就连肥皂剧的导演都可以随便拒绝我们的邀约，说我们是不入流的制片公司，只会拍一些无聊的血腥片段。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"经营不善是事实，资金不济也是事实。坦诚来说，我们已经没有机会拍下一部电影了。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"现在，我也不得不承认，没有人愿意看血腥和暴力的片子了。我们被市场抛弃了。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":22},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"各位员工们，我努力过了，你们也努力过了。但在此，我也不得不通知大家……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"卓越电影制片厂……将在一周后正式关闭。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_62_g9_outsidestudio_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":35,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"啧，说得那么煽情，最后还不是一分钱遣散费都不给！想开人不给钱就直说啊！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"既然是破产，那肯定没有钱能给吧……","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"你就听他骗你吧。他这会正左手倒右手，准备开下一家电影公司呢。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"不信你看看上周的报纸怎么写的，都是路人皆知的事情了！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"可既然要开新的电影公司，为什么不把我们招回去继续干呢？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"人家要做超级大片，想赚更多人的钱。而咱们是靠血浆和尖叫赚钱的，这种东西怎么可能放得进他的新电影里？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"唉……那我们还找得到工作吗？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"蒂比怎么也垂头丧气的？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"我记得你这两年参与了不少大制片厂的电影吧？你都已经打出名气了，肯定不会吃不上饭的。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"……蒂比？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不行，我得去找老板谈谈。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"老板，我有事——","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"蒂比，我在最后的会议上已经说得很明白了，我现在已经是个身无分文的穷光蛋了。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"我当然很想给你们补偿，但眼下的情况就是——片厂破产了，我一分钱都拿不出来。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不，老板，我不是为这事来的。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"……哦？那你是来和我告别的？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"你的好心我收下了，但不用着急告别。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"我只是暂时不开公司了，不代表我之后不做电影。我相信我们很快能在别的片场见面——","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不，老板，我也不是为这件事来的。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"那你是为什么来的？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我就是来问问……仓库里的那些背景板之后会怎么处理？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"……背景板？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"就是之前拍电影时制作的背景，应该都存放在办公室后面的道具仓库里——","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"哦，我想起来了。前两天财务还特意跟我说，光是为了存放这些木板，两年下来让我多花了一百五十三万租金。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"一百五十三万金券……把这些背景板送进木材厂都不一定值三万金券呢。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"我已经叫了人过来处理它们，送进木材厂，还是砍碎当柴烧……算了，爱怎么样怎么样吧。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可、可这些是许多人的心血，也是许多观众的回忆……","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"有人在乎一个烂片公司制作的背景吗？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"蒂比，我承认你是一位出色的场景喷绘师，你在新片《嗜血午夜》里的表现让所有人感到惊艳。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"老实讲，我自己看那些场景的时候，都不敢相信它们其实是一堆涂上颜料的木板。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"这也是为什么你会从这些资质平平的人里面脱颖而出。你的能力优于剧组里的所有人，你画的东西能得到更多人的喜欢。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"但《嗜血午夜》赔了三千万，是我们亏损得最惨的电影，没有之一。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"编剧、导演、摄影、表演，没有一个能行，你绘制的背景板再精美又有什么用？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"观众不买账，电影就没有票房。公司没有业绩支撑，自然就没有新的电影，这再正常不过。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"人总是要进步的。我拍了十几年的恐怖片，现在也该去迎合更多的观众了。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"你难道不想让更多人看见你的作品吗？想的话，就往更高处走。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"蒂比，别人不知道你的身世，但我知道的。回去问问你的爷爷，他也会认可我的观点。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"如果所有人都能多为制片厂着想一点，如果大家能跟上时代潮流，这里也不会变成现在这幅落魄样子。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那……我可以留下其中一幅背景吗？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"那也不行。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"制片厂花钱雇佣了你绘制这些背景，然后拍成电影，制作成数以万计的录像带流入市场。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"那么电影画面里的所有东西都属于卓越影业，你画的背景当然也包括在内。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制片厂老板","text":"你可以翻翻哥伦比亚的版权法，上面也白纸黑字这么写着。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":140},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_bar_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":147},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":148,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"蒂比年纪还小，就用果汁代替……来吧，各位，干完这杯，我们就各奔东西了。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记&蒂比","text":"来。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"0.04","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","loop":"false","channel":"2","delay":"0.06","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"d1","delay":"1","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"d2","delay":"1.6","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"蒂比，你也别闷闷不乐了。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"有些事你不知道，但其实不少人都清楚老板要关掉这个小作坊，去投资他心里想的那些“大电影”，只是时间早晚的问题罢了。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"至于你想要的那块背景板。相信我，你后面画的每一幅背景，都会比它要好。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"现在你的能力已经被大制片厂认可，他们有充足的资源，你会有更多机会实现自己的想法的。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那你们从这离开以后，准备再去哪个片厂干活？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我认识一些不错的雇主，说不定能帮到你们……","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"我吗？算了算了。找个拍广告的工作吧，有些广告公司就喜欢招拍过电影的人。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"哈哈，当然前提是他们没看过我拍的电影。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"艾琳呢？我看你这半年都在看招聘广告，怎么样，找到合意的工作了吗？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"欸，我有这么明显吗？！","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"我用过那个招聘网站，所以有一次看到你在看的时候，一眼就认出来了。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"这、这样啊……","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"老实说，我也不知道自己接下来该干什么……","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"来到这个片厂的四年里，我能干的只有打板、记镜号，打板、记镜号。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"现在叫我去做别的工作，我也拿不定主意……也许回老家重新学一门别的手艺，安分过日子会更适合我吧。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……大家都要离开蓝卡坞吗？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"小蒂比，我能力没你强，运气也没你好。我就是入行比你早点，见过的恶心事比你多点。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"对我来说，还能靠摸着一台摄影机吃饭，已经很好了。是不是蓝卡坞，没有那么重要。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"对于大部分人来说，卓越影业的工作，也只是一份工作而已。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"有时候你坚持一份工作很久，最后发现它并不适合你，这很正常。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"在蓝卡坞，想成名的人太多，能成名的人太少。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可是和你们一起拍电影的时光，对我来说很幸福！","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"在我看来，你们并不比那些拍商业大片的人差，反而在很多时候比那些大片厂的人更有人情味。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"这也是为什么，我依然想在这里和你们共事。我真的很想和你们再多拍几部电影……","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那个老板根本没有理由抛弃你们……！","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"有你的这句话，就足够啦。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"虽然我一开始来蓝卡坞，是因为在学校汇演里被人夸演技好来着。但来到这以后，发现自己就是一个平平无奇的普通人。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"可蒂比，以你的才能，我相信你最后一定会成为写进蓝卡坞影史的喷绘师的。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"你天生就是吃这碗饭的人，所以你一定要在蓝卡坞坚持下去。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"如果有一天你能站在领奖台上领奖，我说不定也会因为跟你共事过，跟老家的人到处吹牛呢！","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可是……可是……","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"唉，本来说好了一起喝酒骂老板的，怎么搞得这么难受！","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"现在酒吧里没有人了，要不我们一起再放个电影看吧。喝喝酒，看看电影，聊聊天，就跟以前一样。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"这次……让蒂比来挑一部电影？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我想想，那就看……我们第一次合作的电影，《坏小子》吧。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"不是，我多少还是有点电影品味的，真不想看自己拍的烂片啊！","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"马修，既然都是最后一次了，就按照蒂比说的来吧。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"……行。那就看《坏小子》。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_bar_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"老旧到偏色的投影机发出嗡嗡的散热声，三个人围在小小的圆桌前，看着最后缓缓滚动的演职员表。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……噗。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"*蓝卡坞片场术语*，这也太尴尬了！这个男的为什么最后能杀到领奖台啊！","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"当时拍的时候怎么没人骂编剧在想什么啊？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"不、不知道……可能就是导演想再要一场血腥戏吧……哎哟，我笑得肚子好痛！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"还有这个镜头……你当时……当时为什么要把人鼻孔拍得那么大啊？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"我、我也不知道啊！我拍了那么多条，怎么能想到最后剪进去一条最丑的啊！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"我不行了……哈哈哈，彻彻底底的烂片！","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哈哈哈哈哈……对！这个片的背景也糙得不行，全部都是我熬了几天几夜赶出来的。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我每次看到最后，都想冲上去把我的名字从演职员表里抠掉……","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"你竟然还看了很多遍？我从来都不看的！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我、我……","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"小蒂比难道会自己偷偷在家欣赏参与过的电影？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"才、才没有！我只是单纯很喜欢这个电影的最后一幕……","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"这个最不明所以的一幕？哈哈哈哈哈哈……","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不是。我喜欢这幕的背景，那个粗糙的领奖台。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你们也许不记得了……这块背景板的后面，有整个剧组所有人的签名。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"等等……有吗？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有的。拍这部电影的时候，我刚刚加入，制片厂也因为经济困难，说是快要倒闭……","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"原本请的演员怕我们开不出工资，临时拒绝了拍摄计划。之后投资方又突然撤资……","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"我知道……那个时候我们都以为这就是最后一部电影了，想着能拍完就是胜利。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"我当时好像还去群演里拉了一个最上镜的，临时做我们的男主演……","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"这个签名，就是最后杀青的时候，大家一起签的。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那时的我们拍完了，不是吗？而且票房竟然意外地不错，甚至有影院第一次给我们排了白天的场次！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那些为了迎合观众刻意加的血腥场面，是我们所有人不得已为之的选择，但观众却觉得很精彩很爽快。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"虽然苟延残喘了两年，制片厂最后还是倒闭了……但我想说，我们已经拯救过它一次，我们并不是失败者！","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"蒂比……所以，你还想挽留我们？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"蒂比，我知道你想鼓励我们。但这一次，制片厂再也没有复活的可能了……","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不，我尊重你们的选择。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"只是，我只想在大家离开之前，再看看那个背景板后的签名……","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……你们想去吗？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"微弱的灯光照亮一件件蒙尘的道具，自化作影像刻录进胶片里后，它们便一直封存于此。","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"2","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"咳咳咳咳咳咳……到处都是灰，呛死人了！","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"（小声）马修，小点声！门口还有门卫呢，万一被发现怎么办！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"（捂住嘴巴）唔……嗯。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"场记","text":"（小声）这些背景板堆起来比好几个我加起来还高……没想到我们居然一起拍过这么多电影！","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影师","text":"（小声）哼，你别说这么厚的背景板了，你记录的表格，我拍过的胶片，哪个堆起来没人高？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":340},{"type":"delay","timr":"3","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"（小声）我找到了！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_bg_28_g10_stage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":350},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":351,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"三人移步到一幅背景板前，即使过了两年，上面的颜料依旧和当初一样鲜艳。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……我们把它翻过来。","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pullcurtain","volume":"1","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“最后的电影”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":360},{"type":"subtitle","id":361},{"type":"subtitle","text":"导演   本·罗伊","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":362},{"type":"subtitle","text":"主演   索菲娅·玛奇   瑞安·哈里斯","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":363},{"type":"subtitle","text":"摄影   马修·托马斯","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":364},{"type":"subtitle","text":"……","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":365},{"type":"subtitle","id":366},{"type":"subtitle","text":"喷绘师   蒂比·布克","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":367},{"type":"subtitle","text":"……","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":368},{"type":"subtitle","text":"场记   艾琳·亨特","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":369},{"type":"subtitle","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你们瞧……这就是我们的“光辉事迹”。","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"“最后的电影”，但并非最后一部，我们拯救过这里。","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"这里堆积如山的背景板，全是我们一起工作的见证。我们一起拍过的场景，甚至可以铺满整个星光大道！","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"（抽泣）","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"马修……你还好吗？","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"没、没事……我、我就是……有点喝多了！","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"强壮的男人此刻正努力地让自己的抽泣声小些。而艾琳的眼眶也明显湿润了。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比牵起身旁两人的手，缓缓向背景板前走去。","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"按《坏小子》里的剧情，现在我们已经逃出了监狱，杀光了会场里所有的反派，然后站上了领奖台——","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那么，作为蓝卡坞最好的摄影师，马修·托马斯先生！还有蓝卡坞最佳场记，艾琳·亨特女士！你们有什么想说的吗？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"我……","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"我想说……","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"（大声）卓越影业，*蓝卡坞片场术语*！","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修&蒂比","text":"……","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":407},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"（更大声）蓝卡坞，*蓝卡坞片场术语*！*蓝卡坞更专业的术语*！","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":410},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"我……卓越影业，*蓝卡坞片场术语*！","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","id":413},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"蓝卡坞，*蓝卡坞片场术语*！","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"三人的声音在仓库里久久地回荡，直到回声完全消失，三人才发出止不住的笑声。","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"哈哈哈……我喝多了……今天我们都喝多了……！","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"刚刚我的脑子里，突然闪过了拍电影的这几年，跟梦一样……太快了！","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"是啊……跟梦一样。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比紧紧地握住马修和艾琳的手，并将它们缓缓举起。","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"各位，现在，该我们向所有观众谢幕了。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"（举起手臂）","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"（举起手臂）","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"唉，要是现在有一束聚光灯就好了……","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":434},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":435},{"type":"playsound","key":"$tactfulboost","volume":"0.6","id":436},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比的话音未落，突然一束强烈而夺目的光线照在了三人身上，晃得他们睁不开眼。","id":437},{"type":"charslot","id":438},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保安","text":"是谁在那里？不许动！","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保安","text":"把手举起来！","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"不好……刚才喊太大声被发现了！我们要跑吗？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","id":444},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":445,"musicid":4},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……必须跑！","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"等下！","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"怎、怎么了？","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾琳","text":"他们就要过来了！","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马修","text":"既然都被发现了，要不……我们一起把这个领奖台偷走？","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比深吸了一口气，她能感受到光束摇晃得越来越剧烈，也离他们越来越近。","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我喜欢这个主意。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":462},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"text","text":"那晚，蓝卡坞的街头突然出现了一幅巨大的移动背景板，背景板上画着一座巨大的领奖台。","id":465},{"type":"text","text":"即使在光怪陆离的蓝卡坞，这样匪夷所思的场景也并不多见。于是，人人纷纷举起相机记录。","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"人们拍到领奖台在蓝卡坞星光大道的人行道上，在名人馆的大门前，在电影广场的正中央……","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"但不知为何，没有人拍清扛着背景板的人，大家只能隐约看到三个模糊的身影。","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"不过这三人的身份并没有引起太多人的关注，这件趣事也只是被作为谈资在饭桌上一笑而过。","id":469},{"type":"text","text":"毕竟对于蓝卡坞来说，能成名的人太少，想成名的人太多。这件事倒是再正常不过。","id":470},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":472},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":473},{"type":"character","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"image","id":476}],"characters":["制片厂老板","摄影师","场记","蒂比","场记&蒂比","马修","艾琳","马修&蒂比","保安"]}